{"page":150,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:158","surah":6,"ayah":158,"ar_uthmani":"هَلْ يَنظُرُونَ إِلَّآ أَن تَأْتِيَهُمُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ أَوْ يَأْتِىَ رَبُّكَ أَوْ يَأْتِىَ بَعْضُ ءَايَـٰتِ رَبِّكَ ۗ يَوْمَ يَأْتِى بَعْضُ ءَايَـٰتِ رَبِّكَ لَا يَنفَعُ نَفْسًا إِيمَـٰنُهَا لَمْ تَكُنْ ءَامَنَتْ مِن قَبْلُ أَوْ كَسَبَتْ فِىٓ إِيمَـٰنِهَا خَيْرًا ۗ قُلِ ٱنتَظِرُوٓا۟ إِنَّا مُنتَظِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Are they waiting for the very angels to come to them, or your Lord Himself, or maybe some of His signs? But on the Day some of your Lord’s signs come, no soul will profit from faith if it had none before, or has not already earned some good through its faith. Say, ‘Wait if you wish: we too are waiting.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Are","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنظُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they waiting","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَأْتِيَهُمُ","en_gloss":"comes to them","transliteration":"tatiyahumu","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَأْتِىَ","en_gloss":"comes","transliteration":"yatiya","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَأْتِىَ","en_gloss":"comes","transliteration":"yatiya","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَعْضُ","en_gloss":"some (of)","transliteration":"baʿḍu","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) Signs","transliteration":"āyāti","verse_key":"6:158"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رَبِّكَ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) your Lord","